    "notes": "Native firmware 0.1.33 \u2014 the send-completion proof: the TFT record counter (tft_md5_seq) is bumped at every 'delivered md5 recorded', persisted in NVS and carried in the register payload; the manager snapshots it when a send is armed and only a HIGHER count can complete the send \u2014 a stale pre-send md5 can never clear the serving slot mid-transfer again (P352). The panel now identifies itself on every TFT fetch (?panel=<hostname>) so the per-panel serving slot engages. Carries all prior fixes.",
